        "Platform considerations",
        "macOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e25a2943e177e8ebcd5ad920fc565da2664f7d928dda4920bf06441286e32e00",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "If your app supports document-specific page settings, consider presenting a page setup dialog",
      "section_path": [
        "Printing",
        "Platform considerations",
        "macOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "10a975d8febe11d9b58712bea2369cb84fb7a7f0149a89ca2794178eaf0d02d2",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sure interdependencies between options are clear",
      "section_path": [
